------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party tools
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sentari ORCHESTRATES external security tools by invoking them as separate
programs. It does not bundle, embed, or distribute any of them, and it does not
create derivative works of them. Each remains the property of its authors under
its own license. When present on the host, Sentari may invoke:

  - nmap            (https://nmap.org)
  - nuclei          (https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei)
  - nikto           (https://github.com/sullo/nikto)
  - gobuster / ffuf (content discovery)
  - sqlmap          (https://sqlmap.org)

Sentari's core runs on the Python standard library alone and functions with
none of the above installed.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Authorized use only
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sentari executes real offensive security tooling. Use it only against systems
you own or are explicitly, in writing, authorized to test. You are solely
responsible for obtaining authorization and complying with applicable law.
